# Open in VS Code with the installed REST Client extension.
# First run in the VS Code PowerShell terminal:
# powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\deploy\translation-dev\Start-PortForward.ps1
# Then click Send Request above either request below.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18081

### Liveness: expected 200 {"status":"alive"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness: expected 503 until business dependencies are implemented
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### DEV API request: mapped route, expected 503 until business dependencies exist.
# Health endpoints are excluded from request telemetry. Use this to generate it.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json
